<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>Bienvenue dans la maison Aurélia · {{ shop.name }}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #FAF6F1; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1A1410; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">

  <div style="display: none; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; mso-hide: all;">
    Bienvenue parmi nous &mdash; un mot de la fondatrice, et -10% sur votre première commande.
  </div>

  <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #FAF6F1;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding: 32px 16px;">

        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" style="max-width: 600px; width: 100%; background-color: #FFFFFF;">

          <!-- HEADER -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 32px 24px 32px; background-color: #FAF6F1;">
              <div style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 36px; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #1A1410; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1;">
                AURÉLIA
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 4px; color: #C9A96E; text-transform: uppercase;">
                Paris &middot; Skincare
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- HÉROS BORDEAUX SUBTIL (crème) -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 56px 32px 16px 32px; background-color: #F5EDE4;">
              <div style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 4px; color: #C9A96E; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 18px;">
                Bienvenue parmi nous
              </div>
              <div style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.2; color: #1A1410; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic;">
                Une lumière douce,<br>une promesse simple.
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="height: 56px; background-color: #F5EDE4; line-height: 56px; font-size: 1px;">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>

          <!-- MESSAGE PERSONNEL -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 48px 40px 24px 40px;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                Bonjour {{ customer.first_name | default: 'chère cliente' }},
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                J'ai fondé Aurélia parce que je cherchais une luminothérapie à la hauteur de ce que la peau mérite : précise, élégante, sans bruit inutile.
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                En rejoignant notre maison, vous recevrez <strong>un seul email par mois</strong> &mdash; jamais davantage. Pas de spam, pas de promesses creuses : nos rituels du moment, les coulisses de l'atelier, et parfois un avant-première.
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                Pour vous souhaiter la bienvenue, voici un présent.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- CODE PROMO -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0 40px 40px 40px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #6B2336;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 24px;">
                    <div style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 4px; color: #C9A96E; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                      Votre cadeau de bienvenue
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.2; color: #FAF6F1; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                      -10 % sur votre première commande
                    </div>
                    <div style="display: inline-block; background-color: #FAF6F1; padding: 16px 32px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
                      <div style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: #6B2336; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px;">Code à saisir au panier</div>
                      <div style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: 6px; color: #1A1410; font-weight: 500;">WELCOME10</div>
                    </div>
                    <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
                      <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 0 auto;">
                        <tr>
                          <td align="center" style="background-color: #FAF6F1;">
                            <a href="{{ shop.url }}/collections/all" style="display: inline-block; padding: 16px 40px; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: #1A1410; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500;">
                              Découvrir la gamme
                            </a>
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </div>
                    <div style="margin-top: 18px; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; color: #C9A96E; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                      Valable 60 jours &middot; non cumulable
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- CE QUE VOUS RECEVREZ -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0 40px 16px 40px;">
              <div style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: #C9A96E; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9A96E; padding-bottom: 12px;">
                Ce que nous vous enverrons
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 24px 40px 8px 40px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
                <tr>
                  <td valign="top" style="padding-bottom: 16px;">
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
                      <tr>
                        <td width="40" valign="top" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #C9A96E; font-style: italic;">I.</td>
                        <td valign="top" style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                          <strong>Un rituel par mois</strong><br>
                          <span style="color: #6B6B6B;">Une routine inspirée par nos esthéticiennes, à essayer.</span>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td valign="top" style="padding-bottom: 16px;">
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
                      <tr>
                        <td width="40" valign="top" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #C9A96E; font-style: italic;">II.</td>
                        <td valign="top" style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                          <strong>Les coulisses de l'atelier</strong><br>
                          <span style="color: #6B6B6B;">Comment nos masques naissent, du croquis à la livraison.</span>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td valign="top">
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
                      <tr>
                        <td width="40" valign="top" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #C9A96E; font-style: italic;">III.</td>
                        <td valign="top" style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                          <strong>Les avant-premières</strong><br>
                          <span style="color: #6B6B6B;">Nos nouveautés vous parviennent avant tout le monde.</span>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- SIGNATURE FONDATRICE -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 40px 40px 48px 40px;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                Bienvenue, et à très vite.
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 16px 0 4px 0; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; color: #6B2336; font-style: italic;">
                Aurélia Marchand
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #C9A96E; text-transform: uppercase;">
                Fondatrice
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- FOOTER avec désabonnement -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 32px; background-color: #1A1410;">
              <div style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 6px; color: #FAF6F1; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                AURÉLIA
              </div>
              <div style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #C9A96E; margin-bottom: 24px; text-transform: uppercase;">
                L'équipe Aurélia &middot; Paris
              </div>
              <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <a href="https://instagram.com/aureliaparis" style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #FAF6F1; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 12px;">Instagram</a>
                <span style="color: #C9A96E;">&middot;</span>
                <a href="https://tiktok.com/@aureliaparis" style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #FAF6F1; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 12px;">TikTok</a>
              </div>
              <div style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.7; color: #8A8580; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                AURÉLIA Paris &middot; 12 rue de Sévigné, 75004 Paris<br>
                <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="color: #8A8580; text-decoration: underline;">{{ shop.url | remove: 'https://' | remove: 'http://' }}</a>
              </div>
              <div style="border-top: 1px solid #2A241F; padding-top: 16px; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.6; color: #8A8580;">
                Vous recevez cet email car vous vous êtes inscrite à notre lettre.<br>
                <a href="{% if unsubscribe_url %}{{ unsubscribe_url }}{% else %}{{ shop.url }}/account{% endif %}" style="color: #C9A96E; text-decoration: underline;">Se désabonner</a>
                <span style="color: #4A4540;">&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;</span>
                <a href="{{ shop.url }}/policies/privacy-policy" style="color: #C9A96E; text-decoration: underline;">Confidentialité</a>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
